# Farming hard-no

Do **not** build the $100/day plan on:

- 1,000%+ (or tiny-TVL "50,000%") headline APY
- Unknown protocols or unaudited contracts as Core
- Brand-new farms as Core
- Leverage loops / recursive supply-borrow in Phase 1
- Borrowing against volatile collateral
- Treating reward tokens as USDT income
- Chasing APY every few hours
- Merging Pump.fun / memecoin capital into the DeFi treasury
- Agent-sent transactions or key handling

Fail closed: if unsure, **WATCH** in Alpha or **FAIL**. Log the verdict with `/update`.
